questions.question_es:
Una capa anticorrupción traduce el payload del contexto CRM al modelo del contexto Facturación. ¿Qué imprime?

```python
class Invoice:  # modelo interno de Facturacion
    def __init__(self, customer_id, total_cents):
        self.customer_id = customer_id
        self.total_cents = total_cents

crm_payload = {"clientRef": "C-9", "amount": "12.50", "currency": "EUR"}

def translate(payload):
    cents = int(round(float(payload["amount"]) * 100))
    return Invoice(payload["clientRef"], cents)

inv = translate(crm_payload)
print(inv.customer_id, inv.total_cents)
```

